WEBVTT

00:00:01.200 --> 00:00:10.534
The Ace to Five of Pentacles trace the practical side of life from a first
opportunity through balance, craft and security to a time of scarcity.

00:00:11.834 --> 00:00:12.899
Ace of Pentacles.

00:00:12.899 --> 00:00:15.469
Opportunity, a fresh start, groundedness.

00:00:15.469 --> 00:00:19.856
A hand emerges from a cloud offering a
single pentacle above a garden.

00:00:21.156 --> 00:00:22.254
Two of Pentacles.

00:00:22.254 --> 00:00:24.321
Balance, juggling, adaptability.

00:00:24.321 --> 00:00:30.456
A figure juggles two pentacles linked by an infinity-
shaped loop while ships ride waves behind.

00:00:31.856 --> 00:00:34.245
Have a tarot spread in front of you?

00:00:34.245 --> 00:00:39.089
Photograph it at readmyspread.com, and get
a clear reading, card by card.
